<title>USA: American Materials Q3 sales up 41 pct.</title>
<headline>American Materials Q3 sales up 41 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Materials &amp; Technologies Corp said preliminary third quarter sales rose 41 percent to $5.7 million from the year-ago quarter.</p>
<p>The company said sales increased 36.4 percent to $16.4 million in the first three quarters of the year over the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>American Materials announced the figures at a presentation to Los Angeles area council of the National Association of Investors Corp.</p>
</text>
